{"id":"n78042-1-8","stage":5,"title":"쪽지 · 纸片","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78042-1-8-1","ko":"어디 메모할 데가 없니?","zh":"没有地方可以记笔记吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디","meaning":"一个地方","explanation":"어디：一个地方","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"메모할","meaning":"记录，留言","explanation":"메모하다：记录，留言；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"메모하다","audio":"/audio/df4cef3ade71b492c1b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55808","senseId":"1","lemma":"메모하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데가","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없니?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"一个地方","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代没有向听话人表明的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"df4cef3ade71b492","term":"메모하다","zh":"记录，留言","audio":"/audio/df4cef3ade71b492c1b8.mp3","entryId":"55808","definition":"为了防止遗忘或转达给别人而把某种内容用文字简单写下来。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/026cfe2bf56fb488a61f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78042-1-8-2","ko":"여기 쪽지가 있어요. 여기에 쓰세요.","zh":"这里有便签纸，您可以在这里写。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쪽지가","meaning":"纸片，纸条","explanation":"쪽지：纸片，纸条；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쪽지","audio":"/audio/919bd592cbdee0ffef28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78042","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰세요.","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰다：写；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"919bd592cbdee0ff","term":"쪽지","zh":"纸片，纸条","audio":"/audio/919bd592cbdee0ffef28.mp3","entryId":"78042","definition":"小纸块儿。","pronunciation":["쪽찌"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"用铅笔或其它笔等书写工具在纸张等上划线而书写一定的字。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4629051f3ed95d41e25f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.495,"source